docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v67-r1.log:955:src/hivemind/placement.py:7:a link the extraction gave to one of its own candidates (c1 …) is kept as it is, the placer decides only the links to existing theses. Measured on the frozen gold over three draws: core statements filed right
