docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v67-r3.log:108:**Evidence bloat, before anything else downstream:** not solved, reduced at the source. The window rule (D198, judging-v5) hides old pieces by recency, not by count: in the sealed three-month ledger the largest judging request after it (Data Center revenue) still showed 647 pieces (1,185 hidden), 93,634 input tokens, because a broad thesis took 40–60 new links a day. Placement under the one-home rule (D207–D209) cut the first week's links per item 3.3 → 1.82 and the largest thesis's links 106 → 52, the largest judging request 15,229 → 8,649 tokens (`english-v38-nvda-1w-2026-10-28` against the sealed ledger's same week), measured over one week with role-v22 only. The decisive test is the whole-pipeline run over the three-month window with `poc-v69` (on Alex's go, with a cap), read for links per thesis, the largest judging request and any halt; the structural answer, a versioned argument record per question for the judge to read, is designed nowhere yet (handoff plan T6).
docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v67-r3.log:487:2591-- Measured ([results](research/2026-10-27-stage34-gold/results.md), 2026-10-27 23:05–23:30, $0.24): the 24-case gold was written, then re-read as a hedge-fund analyst's standard (eight rules in `gold.md`, Alex: "做一个 hedge fund analyst 的专业视角去看怎么做这一步的标准"). One send per case of the new path (step 2 reader → Jev opinions → one gpt-6-luna call with the complete context): step 4 places and merges right on 20 of 21 development and 3 of 3 held-out cases, never retires a different statement; two misses (G09 the denial not written into the argument, G11 a bank's echo taken as independent). Jev's piece opinions are right on 7 of 18; the product's replace class has its mechanism in the `supersedes` criterion ("an official confirms or denies that reported claim"): re-sending the 47 stored replacements, 16 do not reproduce and 7 flip to a `contradicts` class once the clause is split out. Two harness contradictions of the assistant's (a check refusing what the prompt asked; the record's own id) were fixed at $0, and nine gold rows were corrected from verified ledger ids (the gold had been written from a ranked excerpt, not the complete expansion). No production change yet: the writer still acts on Jev's label.
