docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v69-r1.log:1412:- D167–D169: no hard-coded identity; the measure vocabulary gains `market_size` and `project_cost`; the Jev engine (`views/jev_matching.py`, client `jev.py`) with the PRD's replacement definition, the shared succession rule and an answer for "the same quantity, another period"; a repeat may name the piece shown for the same evidence under another thesis.
docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v69-r1.log:1415:- D207–D211: extraction reads, then files (`extraction.read_item`, `extraction.file_reading`); under a ledger-blind version the request depends on the item alone, so the parallel day prepares the read early and files it at the item's turn; the placement call files statements, and a statement filed nowhere is dropped as `no home` (the `unplaced_statements` table is retired). After placement the sift's candidate rule runs again (`extraction.candidates_with_evidence`): a candidate left with none of its evidence is dropped, so no thesis opens without evidence (close-out review; 0 of 222 candidates under poc-v67, 25 of 5,805 over all stored loop answers).
docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v69-r1.log:1421:- The placement setting is checked before the paid extraction call; the credential guard in tests raises `pytest.fail`, which the pipeline's `except Exception` cannot swallow.
docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v69-r1.log:1431:**Evidence bloat, before anything else downstream:** not solved, reduced at the source. The window rule (D198, judging-v5) hides old pieces by recency, not by count: in the sealed three-month ledger the largest judging request after it (Data Center revenue) still showed 647 pieces (1,185 hidden), 93,634 input tokens, because a broad thesis took 40–60 new links a day. Placement under the one-home rule (D207–D209) cut the first week's links per item 3.3 → 1.82 and the largest thesis's links 106 → 52, the largest judging request 15,229 → 8,649 tokens (`english-v38-nvda-1w-2026-10-28` against the sealed ledger's same week), measured over one week with role-v22 only. The decisive test is the whole-pipeline run over the three-month window with `poc-v69` (on Alex's go, with a cap), read for links per thesis, the largest judging request and any halt; the structural answer, a versioned argument record per question for the judge to read, is designed nowhere yet (handoff plan T6).
docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v69-r1.log:1504:docs/DECISIONS.md:2591:- Measured ([results](research/2026-10-27-stage34-gold/results.md), 2026-10-27 23:05–23:30, $0.24): the 24-case gold was written, then re-read as a hedge-fund analyst's standard (eight rules in `gold.md`, Alex: "做一个 hedge fund analyst 的专业视角去看怎么做这一步的标准"). One send per case of the new path (step 2 reader → Jev opinions → one gpt-6-luna call with the complete context): step 4 places and merges right on 20 of 21 development and 3 of 3 held-out cases, never retires a different statement; two misses (G09 the denial not written into the argument, G11 a bank's echo taken as independent). Jev's piece opinions are right on 7 of 18; the product's replace class has its mechanism in the `supersedes` criterion ("an official confirms or denies that reported claim"): re-sending the 47 stored replacements, 16 do not reproduce and 7 flip to a `contradicts` class once the clause is split out. Two harness contradictions of the assistant's (a check refusing what the prompt asked; the record's own id) were fixed at $0, and nine gold rows were corrected from verified ledger ids (the gold had been written from a ranked excerpt, not the complete expansion). No production change yet: the writer still acts on Jev's label.
docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v69-r1.log:1507:docs/DECISIONS.md:2630:## D207 · 2026-10-28 · Statements are filed by a separate placement call under the one-home rule; an unfiled statement is kept (extraction v20, `poc-v36`)
docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v69-r1.log:1508:docs/DECISIONS.md:2632:- Alex, on the root cause ("你还是没有根因的去解决这个问题 … 要么挂不到，要么挂多"; "跑那个归档实验"; "你看着结果来做"; "一样的标准开始测"). The mechanism ([routing-analysis.md](research/2026-10-28-extraction-quality/routing-analysis.md)): the in-call link decision was a coin flip (36% right on the gold, 46–78 pieces kept from the same bytes) and the gate at once (an unlinked statement was dropped: 60% of all statements, ~15–30% of them material); the link rule routed demand news to the company-wide quantities (six root theses held 66% of all links; v2's pieces 86% double-linked, 26% cited); the thesis list had no driver layer.
docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v69-r1.log:1513:docs/DECISIONS.md:2723:- On 2026-10-29 an independently prompted model read the 49 archived cases without prior labels and produced a finding for each. Its tentative 5/21/23 split across placement, extraction and no suitable question is not an accepted census: it missed context carried by other statements in a real request and marked some destination choices uncertain while still assigning placement. The [case-by-case review](research/2026-10-28-retention-audit/independent-49-assessment-2026-10-29.md) keeps the raw model output and separates a confirmed missing revenue metric from disputed destinations. Model agreement is not a source, and model-authored judgements require calibration against the frozen standard.
docs/research/2026-10-31-reference-context/codex-audit-role-v69-r1.log:1528:docs/DECISIONS.md:2824:Alex directs that the thesis-library evidence standard and prior hedge-fund analyst ledger review must both be applied, allows reasonable ambiguity, and asks to stop and leave a complete retrospective and current state. Both worktrees’ `AGENTS.md` §8 now point to the sources and require judging source, investment use and question admission separately. The eight-question research review is context, not a replacement for Alex’s decisions, adopted PRDs or frozen gold. Existing routing rules, including D209, remain unchanged. Gold examples inform judgment; optional details or differing labels do not become a rigid pass/fail. The [handoff](research/2026-10-29-claim-use/handoff-2026-10-29.md) preserves the failures, evidence, experiment limitations, active worktree and next task. No further experiment, product change, default switch, commit, push or deployment.
